			<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-71b9be0 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="71b9be0" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-253493e elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-title elementor-page-title elementor-widget-heading" data-id="253493e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="theme-post-title.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Spurs must make NBA history to overcome 0-2 deficit vs. Knicks</h1>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-344fc0d elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-excerpt" data-id="344fc0d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="theme-post-excerpt.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					Now down 0-2 to the New York Knicks in the NBA Finals, the San Antonio Spurs have to do something no team in league history has done.				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e52884e elementor-widget elementor-widget-post-info" data-id="e52884e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="post-info.default">
